This work is an independent research artifact associated with the following
publication:

  Towards Sustainability-oriented Business Process Analysis using Process Mining,
  Nathalie Wolf, Dominik Scharpf, Holger Wittges, Stefanie Rinderle-Ma,
  Accepted for publication at the BPM4S Workshop, co-located with the
  International Conference on Business Process Management (BPM),
  Springer Nature Switzerland AG, 2026

This artifact is referenced in the publication via URL and was not
submitted to Springer Nature Switzerland AG as supplementary material.
It remains an independent work under CC BY 4.0.

